# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
#
# Style for handwritten C in this repository: ABI probes and, if ever
# unavoidable, shims. Based on the Google C++ Style Guide, narrowed to the
# two settings this project fixes explicitly.
#
# This file must never be used to rename OpenVINO C symbols or to reorder
# struct fields. Formatting is subordinate to ABI correctness.
#
# Pin the clang-format version in CI. Do not upgrade the formatter in the
# same commit as a functional change.

---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
IndentWidth: 2
ColumnLimit: 80
UseTab: Never
InsertNewlineAtEOF: true

# Include order is fixed by STYLE_GUIDE.md as: the matching project header,
# then C standard library headers, then OpenVINO and third-party headers.
# Automatic sorting would reorder those groups alphabetically and break the
# guarantee that a probe's own header compiles standalone.
SortIncludes: false
